[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="ItemDef" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/world/item_def.gd" id="1_item"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item")
id = &"lore_laying_out"
display_name = "The Order of the Laying Out"
spine_colour = Color(0.36, 0.14, 0.12, 1)
text = "[i]Placeholder text: replace or approve.[/i]

The rule for those who keep the niches. Wash the hands. Bind at the feet, the knee, the waist, the breast and the throat, five bands and no more. Lay the head toward the way you came.

The same rule, in the same words, is given a second time further on, for books. Nobody has troubled to change a word of it.

In the margin, in another hand: [i]Which came first? Ask the old keeper. Do not ask twice.[/i]"
